{"drug":{"value":"http://www4.wiwiss.fu-berlin.de/drugbank/resource/drugs/DB00273","type":"uri"},"mass":{"value":"339.0988","type":"literal"},"transform":{"value":"Not extensively metabolized, 70% of the dose is eliminated unchanged in the urine. The other 30% is metabolized hepatically to six metabolites (formed by hydroxylation, hydrolysis, and glucuronidation), none of which constitute more than 5% of an administered dose.","type":"literal"}},
